 "about": "Kernel vocabulary of questions (ask) and reports (report): the 14 question aspects, preference slots and other question details, the word synonyms the subject matcher uses, the report issue words with their classes and evidence fields, report states, quantities with their units, and severities (docs/design/TIER1_SWEEP.md 4.1, 4.4, 4.7, 5.2; docs/DIALOGUE.md). Domains add their own words in data/vocab/<domain>.json (same sections; a key defined twice across files fails at load). Matching is lexical: lower case, punctuation stripped, plurals singularized, then this file's synonym table. Sources: plain household English; unit factors are the exact SI definitions (NIST SP 811, Appendix B).",
